enting a specific method for assessing performance.', 'A metric used to evaluate the overlap between the predicted bounding box and the ground truth bounding box. In the context of the KITTI dataset, proposal boxes having an IoU greater than 70% are counted as true detections for cars.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1, 1]}, 'PASCAL': {'type': ['dataset'], 'description': ['A dataset used for object detection, mentioned in comparison to the KITTI dataset, highlighting the challenges of adapting Faster R-CNN from PASCAL to KITTI due to differences in image sizes.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'CONV5_3': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A specific convolutional layer within the VGG16 CNN architecture. The paper uses features from this layer as input to both the region proposal network (RPN) and the classification network.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'Fully connected layers': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['Layers used as the R-CNN branch for VGG16 and AlexNet architectures. These layers are fully connected and used for classification after feature extraction by the convolutional layers.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'Input Resolution': {'type': ['task'], 'description': ['The size of the input images used in the Faster R-CNN model, which significantly impacts detection accuracy. The paper investigates the effect of different input resolutions, such as 2000x604 and 5000x1510, on car detection performance.'], 'source_chunk_index': [2]}, 'Context Window': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['An additional feature extraction branch added to the R-CNN framework to improve accuracy. It trains on features extracted from a context window, and its features are concatenated with the original R-CNN features before classification.'], 'source_chunk_index': [2]}, 'Inference Time': {'type': ['task'], 'description': ['The time taken to perform object detection, a key metric for evaluating the efficiency of the Faster R-CNN method.'], 'source_chunk_index': [2]}, 'Faster R-CNN